  "scope": "All four printed counterexamples with actual partial derivatives, counting fibres and integral relations. Prove bounded nonmeasurable sine weight with infinite target integral and nonmeasurable source; nonmeasurable pullback for the planar axis projection with both area integrals zero; exact printed oscillatory curve locally absolutely continuous and reciprocal-root weight globally summable, but no common signed substitution value; absolute-value map with identically zero signed fibre sum and nonintegrable actual source. Include the closed principal-branch endpoint regression for sine levels -1 and 1. The oscillatory proof derives actual level counts from disjoint cycles and proves weighted upper-integral divergence through disjoint squared dyadic bands.",
